# VoiceGuard AI

An AI-powered Deepfake Voice & Scam Detection System.

## Features

- Deepfake Voice Detection
- Speech-to-Text
- Scam Classification
- Emotion Detection
- Audio Visualization
- PDF Report Generation
- Streamlit Dashboard

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- Librosa
- Whisper
- Scikit-learn
- Transformers
- Plotly